Usage: exa-cli [options] [command]

CLI for the Exa AI API - web search, content retrieval, and AI answers

Options:
  -V, --version   output the version number
  --json          Output as JSON (default: false)
  --format <fmt>  Output format: text, json, csv, yaml (default: "text")
  --verbose       Enable debug logging (default: false)
  --no-color      Disable colored output
  --no-header     Omit table/csv headers (for piping)
  -h, --help      display help for command

Commands:
  auth            Manage API authentication
  search          Search the web using Exa AI
  contents        Retrieve page contents from URLs
  answer          Get AI-powered answers with citations
  context         Get context and code snippets from the web
  help [command]  display help for command
